-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §29 שעות מילוי מקום: substitution — by the
-- rules in use before the signing; for a staff teacher under the reform,
-- 125% of the hour value of §31, also on the free day; in place of a stay
-- hour, 125% and not the stay hour's 100%, or both where the stay hour is
-- done on another day; pension contributions on it; and the old rules for
-- one employed only as a substitute.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common
IMPORT `31`

§ `29 שעות מילוי מקום`

-- akn:art_29__para_a Substitution follows the rules in use on the eve of the signing, which the corpus does not hold here; no rule of this agreement's own.

DECLARE `when the substitution hour is done` IS ONE OF
    `on a working day, not in place of a stay hour`
    `on the teacher's free day`
    `in place of a stay hour that day, the stay hour not done`
    `in place of a stay hour that day, the stay hour done on another day`

`the substitution rate` MEANS 125%
`the stay hour's own rate` MEANS 100%

GIVEN w IS A `when the substitution hour is done`
GIVETH A `use of the hour value`
DECIDE `the hour value's use for` w IS
    CONSIDER w
    WHEN `in place of a stay hour that day, the stay hour not done` THEN `a substitution hour in place of a stay hour, paid instead of it (§29(ד))`
    WHEN `in place of a stay hour that day, the stay hour done on another day` THEN `a substitution hour in place of a stay hour, done on another day (§29(ה))`
    OTHERWISE `a substitution hour, not in place of a stay hour`

-- (ב)–(ה): a staff teacher under the reform: 125% of the hour value (ב),
-- also on the free day (ג); in place of a stay hour, the 125% and not the
-- stay hour's 100% (ד); if the stay hour is done on another day, the 125%
-- and the stay hour's 100% as well (ה). The base of each is §31's.
@ref akn:art_29__para_b akn:art_29__para_c akn:art_29__para_d akn:art_29__para_e
GIVEN w IS A `when the substitution hour is done`, p IS A `pay for the hour value`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `pay for a substitution hour` w p IS
    `the substitution rate` TIMES `the hour value for` (`the hour value's use for` w) p

-- The stay hour's regular pay for the hour the substitution replaced: none
-- under (ד), and the 100% under (ה), the hour being done on another day.
GIVEN w IS A `when the substitution hour is done`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the stay hour's own pay kept, as a share of the hour` w IS
    CONSIDER w
    WHEN `in place of a stay hour that day, the stay hour not done` THEN 0
    OTHERWISE `the stay hour's own rate`

-- (ו): pension contributions (5% employer, 5% employee) on the substitution
-- pay not included in the regular position's pay, by the agreement of
-- 17.12.98.
@ref akn:art_29__para_f
`the employer's contribution on substitution pay` MEANS 5%
`the employee's contribution on substitution pay` MEANS 5%

-- (ז): one employed only in substitution, not otherwise a teaching employee
-- of the State, stays on the rules before the signing.
@ref akn:art_29__para_g
GIVEN `employed only as a substitute` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `section 29(ב)–(ו) apply` `employed only as a substitute` IF
    NOT `employed only as a substitute`

-- The placeholder teacher of §31 (50 an hour on the combined salary, 55 on
-- it with the role allowances).
`a teacher substituting` MEANS
    `pay for the hour value` WITH
        `combined salary`             IS 7794
        `special-education allowance` IS 0
        `pensionable role allowances` IS 779.4
        `a special-education teacher substituting in a special-education class` IS FALSE

#ASSERT `pay for a substitution hour` `on the teacher's free day` `a teacher substituting` EQUALS 62.5
#ASSERT `pay for a substitution hour` `in place of a stay hour that day, the stay hour not done` `a teacher substituting` EQUALS 68.75
#ASSERT `the stay hour's own pay kept, as a share of the hour` `in place of a stay hour that day, the stay hour done on another day` EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `the stay hour's own pay kept, as a share of the hour` `in place of a stay hour that day, the stay hour not done` EQUALS 0
